/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (Waste is typically collected at scheduled times. Sometimes a bin gets full before it is picked up.Sometimes when it is collected, the bin is almost empty. This can be inefficient and time consuming. Our smart dustbin regularly checks the dustbin . It shows the fullness of the bin and the amount of waste in it. It can also use past information to estimate when the bin might be full. This helps the workers in collecting the waste before the bin overflows.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
