/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (The Predictive Waste Management System is an uncomplicated smart dustbin project. It monitors the volume and weight of waste and sends an alert when the bin is nearly overflowing. It also analyzes the previous data meaning it helps predict when the bin is going to be full. The project is simple to present and inexpensive at the same time.)
