328 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project is a smart dustbin that will monitor the waste level in it. It also weighs the trash. This information is collected by small devices placed in the bin. The information is displayed on a small screen. The green, yellow and red lights indicate the bin status. When the bin is almost full a buzzer gives sound. The system can also use previous readings to get an idea of when the bin may be full. The main objective is to collect the waste at the right time and not allow bins to overflow. The project is straightforward and inexpensive.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 283 0 R
>>
endobj
