410 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system not tracks the current fill level but also predicts when the bin will reach capacity based on usage patterns. This helps optimize collection schedules without requiring human oversight. It supports detection of issues like high temperature or poor air quality inside the bin, which could indicate fire risks or biological decomposition problems. By integrating sensors and using lightweight machine-learning models it delivers accurate predictions while staying cost-effective. The goal is to create a solution that works well in both urban and rural areas where waste management resources are limited. This system can be easily installed in spaces, residential buildings or small commercial zones. Its modular design allows upgrades, such, as adding solar power or connectivity options. Overall this approach brings together simplicity, affordability and intelligence to make waste management smarter and more sustainable.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 416 0 R
/Next 406 0 R
>>
endobj
