416 0 obj
<<
/Title (Based on these studies there is an opportunity to develop an low-cost predictive smart-bin system that combines multiple sensor parameters with local monitoring and fullness prediction. Our proposed system addresses this by using an ESP32 with fill-level, weight, temperature, humidity and air-quality sensors along with an OLED, LEDs and buzzer for status indication. This one also aims to keep the design affordable and scalable for communities or pilot projects. It uses processing to reduce dependency on cloud services and allows faster response times through real-time alerts.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 419 0 R
/Next 410 0 R
>>
